title: "member_team_association (stem-bot-v2: table.sql)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_member: receive (member_id, team_id)
    q_validate_member --> q_error_member: member_id not in member.members
    q_error_member --> [*]: FK violation on member_id
    q_validate_member --> q_validate_team: member_id exists
    q_validate_team --> q_error_team: team_id not in member.teams
    q_error_team --> [*]: FK violation on team_id
    q_validate_team --> q_check_duplicate: team_id exists
    q_check_duplicate --> q_error_dup: (member_id, team_id) already exists
    q_error_dup --> [*]: PRIMARY KEY violation (duplicate assignment)
    q_check_duplicate --> q_insert: pair is unique
    q_insert --> [*]: member assigned to team

    note right of q_validate_member
        INV-001: (member_id, team_id) is composite PRIMARY KEY (unique pair)
        INV-002: member_id REFERENCES member.members ON DELETE CASCADE
        INV-003: team_id REFERENCES member.teams ON DELETE CASCADE
        INV-004: Many-to-many relation (member can be in multiple teams)
        INV-005: No additional constraints (any member can join any team)
    end note
